><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2218\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2218\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. The pitch of the helical path taken by the proton is __________ <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.889ex\" height=\"1.038ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -448 1277 459\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"63\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-63\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. (Take, mass of proton <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.466ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17.024ex\" height=\"2.437ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -871.1 7524.5 1077.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1055.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data